*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0025
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-06-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 391
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0025.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY LON0025C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> MAXIMUM LOAN AMOUNT
    05 MAX-PRINCIPAL      PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM MAX-LOAN-CALC
    DISPLAY "MAX-PRINCIPAL=" MAX-PRINCIPAL
    STOP RUN.
MAX-LOAN-CALC.
    *> ESTABLISHED EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE - LIMIT 5.25 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF EMPLOY-YEARS NOT < 7
        COMPUTE MAX-PRINCIPAL = ANNUAL-INCOME * 5
    ELSE
        *> STANDARD EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE - LIMIT 2.25 PER 1998 POLICY
        IF EMPLOY-YEARS NOT < 3
            COMPUTE MAX-PRINCIPAL = ANNUAL-INCOME * 3
        ELSE
            COMPUTE MAX-PRINCIPAL ROUNDED = ANNUAL-INCOME * 1.5
        END-IF
    END-IF.
